{"id":"wb-6-592","name":"正顺庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"正顺庙","text":"正顺庙位于中华人民共和国福建省三明市三元区河西路6号，是三明境内始建年代最早、保存最完好的木构建筑，庙内祀奉地方神谢祐。2006年，正顺庙被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%AD%A3%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%99","revisionId":88633857,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88633857","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/32ca044e2f53b43697f2f54e.jpg","title":"正顺庙_20241026_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%AD%A3%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%99_20241026_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/%E6%AD%A3%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%99_20241026_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"FradonStar","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"​正顺庙，位于福建省三明市三元区","width":320,"height":240}}